        1   block-level on error undo, throw.
        2   using ibs.th.gbl.sys.objsrv.
        3   define input-output parameter ObjSrv as class objsrv no-undo.
        4   define new global shared variable g#libobj  as handle no-undo .
        5   if not valid-handle (g#libobj)
        6     then run gbl/libobj.p persistent.
        7   run GetObjServ in g#libobj (input-output ObjSrv).
